<span style="font-family: Wingdings"><span id="xdx_901_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20230929__20230929_zocXPeM3PZFf"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2023-09-29" format="ixt:booleanfalse" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">o</ix:nonNumeric></span></span><span style="font-family: Wingdings; font-size: 10pt"></span></p>

